<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Exxon cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Exxon cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- A.G. Edwards analyst Joe Culp downgraded Exxon Corp to accumulate from buy, his office said.</p>
<p>-- raised the 18-month price target to $110 from $98, but said the rate of appreciation that the stock has experienced in the past two years is going to slow, according to his office.  </p>
<p>-- Shares, which traded at 63-3/4 on January 3, 1994, were unchanged at 100-1/8 at mid-morning on Friday.</p>
</text>
